        "name": "USN-9070-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Hiredis did not check the return values of memory allocation functions in some places, leading to a NULL pointer dereference. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause applications using Hiredis to crash, resulting in a denial of service.",
